---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
---

<StarlightPage frontmatter={{ title: 'Terms of Service', template: 'splash', hero: { tagline: '' } }}>
  <div class="legal-page" data-testid="terms-page">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Effective date: October 15, 2026 · ioTACTICAL LLC (“RTMX”, “we”, “us”)</p>
    </header>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>1. Agreement</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing rtmx.ai, creating an account, using managed Sync, CLI login against the
        managed host, or purchasing a paid plan, you agree to these Terms. If you use the
        service on behalf of an organization, you represent that you can bind that organization.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>2. The service</h2>
      <p>
        RTMX provides requirements-traceability tooling and optional hosted Sync for humans and
        agents. Features, limits, and pricing may change; paid entitlements are described at
        checkout and in your account. Self-managed and air-gapped deployments remain your
        responsibility to operate and secure.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>3. Accounts and acceptable use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep credentials confidential; you are responsible for activity under your account and API keys.</li>
        <li>Do not probe, disrupt, or abuse the service; do not circumvent billing or entitlement controls.</li>
        <li>Do not upload unlawful content or content you lack rights to process.</li>
        <li>Agent automation is permitted within your org’s entitlements and these Terms.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>4. Your content</h2>
      <p>
        You retain ownership of requirements and collaboration data you submit. You grant us a
        limited license to host, process, and transmit that data solely to operate managed Sync
        and related features. You are responsible for the legality of your content and for
        configuring access (org membership, keys, IdPs) appropriately.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>5. Open-source software</h2>
      <p>
        The RTMX CLI and related open-source components are licensed under their respective
        open-source licenses on GitHub. These Terms govern the managed website and Sync service,
        not the open-source license grants for the CLI itself.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>6. Fees and billing</h2>
      <p>
        Paid plans are billed through Stripe. Fees are due as stated at purchase. Taxes may
        apply. Unless required by law or stated otherwise, fees are non-refundable. We may
        suspend access for non-payment. Enterprise and on-prem agreements may supersede this
        section where separately executed.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>7. Beta and preview features</h2>
      <p>
        Private beta and preview features are provided as-is, may change or end without notice,
        and may have reduced availability or support.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>8. Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>
        THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED “AS IS” AND “AS AVAILABLE” WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND,
        EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND
        NON-INFRINGEMENT. We do not warrant uninterrupted or error-free operation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, IOTACTICAL LLC AND ITS SUPPLIERS ARE NOT LIABLE
        FOR INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR LOST PROFITS,
        DATA, OR GOODWILL. OUR AGGREGATE LIABILITY FOR CLAIMS ARISING OUT OF THE SERVICE IS
        LIMITED TO THE AMOUNTS YOU PAID US FOR THE SERVICE IN THE TWELVE (12) MONTHS BEFORE THE
        CLAIM.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>10. Termination</h2>
      <p>
        You may stop using the service at any time. We may suspend or terminate access for
        breach, risk, or non-payment. Upon termination, your right to use managed Sync ends;
        sections that by nature should survive (including ownership, disclaimers, and liability
        limits) survive.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>11. Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the United States and the State of Virginia,
        excluding conflict-of-law rules, unless a separately signed agreement says otherwise.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>12. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms by posting a revised version on this page. Continued use after
        the effective date constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <h2>13. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        ioTACTICAL LLC<br />
        Legal: <a href="mailto:legal@rtmx.ai">legal@rtmx.ai</a><br />
        General: <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </p>
      <p class="legal-related">Also see our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</StarlightPage>

<style is:global>
  .legal-page { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 3rem; color: var(--rtmx-text); }
  .legal-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .legal-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rtmx-emerald) 0%, var(--rtmx-emerald-light) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
  }
  .legal-meta { color: var(--rtmx-text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .legal-section { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .legal-section h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--rtmx-emerald-light); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .legal-section p, .legal-section li { color: var(--rtmx-text-muted); line-height: 1.65; }
  .legal-section ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0; }
  .legal-section li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal-related { margin-top: 1rem; }
</style>
